27702 Kaddar dwarf weaponsmith~
Kaddar the armorer~
A stout dwarf stands here fuming.
~
   Of all the dwarves in the realms none can match up to the ability of Kaddar
to make weapons.  For more than three-hundred years Kaddar has been creating
the finest weapons and armor.  He didn't see the need to assist his fellow
dwarves in taking the mountain hoping that siding with the humans and staying
in the city would save his business and the relations with the humans.  Alas
the city has closed down his business and taken all of his weapons and any more
that he makes to help them win the war.  Held in his massive hands is his
greatest creation, the axe Kaddadea, the foe slayer.    
~
